      "text_helper": "Section 8.10.4 \"PWR voltage monitor control register (PWR_VMCR)\" in chapter 8 (Power control (PWR)), RM0522 Rev 1, page 245.",
      "section_content": "Address offset: 0x034\nReset value: 0x0000 0000\nThis register is protected against unprivileged access when PRIV=1 in PWR_PRIVCFGR\nregister.\nThe PVDE bit is protected by lock mechanism. The lock control is in the SBS module\ncontrolled by PVDL bit in SBS_CFGR2 register. By default, the PVDE is unlocked.\nBits 31:1 Reserved, must be kept at reset value.\nBit 0 PVDE: PVD enable\n0: PVD disabled\n1: PVD enabled",
